# generated data worklists
#
# Snapshots of what the database is currently missing, written to the repository
# root by ad-hoc scripts. They are derived entirely from live table state and go
# stale the moment more data is ingested, so a committed copy is misleading
# rather than useful. Nothing in the source reads them.
rankings-needed.json
*-needed.json
